plying a thin layer of paint is called:", "options": ["Glazing", "Impasto", "Scumbling", "Wash"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Glazing is a thin translucent layer.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "ee13450b-3f11-41dd-a661-0c55eb0ddf7e", "subject_id": "fart", "subject_name": "Fine Arts", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "What is the meaning of the term \"avant-garde\"?", "options": ["Cutting edge or innovative", "Traditional", "Classical", "Decorative"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Avant-garde means innovative and experimental.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "3b6806b0-a498-4871-98c7-ab2943027186", "subject_id": "fart", "subject_name": "Fine Arts", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "Which artist is famous for the painting \"Guernica\"?", "options": ["Pablo Picasso", "Salvador Dali", "Francisco Goya", "Diego Velazquez"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Picasso painted Guernica.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "1f682c8a-b446-4e0d-9c50-a7a0437dce8a", "subject_id": "fart", "subject_name": "Fine Arts", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The element of design that deals with the area around, above, and within objects is:", "options": ["Space", "Form", "Line", "Color"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Space refers to the area around objects.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "5b0fcf72-e295-4c73-82fe-da74a91ff560", "subject_id": "fart", "subject_name": "Fine Arts", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "What is the primary focus of the art movement \"Pop Art\"?", "options": ["Mass media and popular culture", "Nature and landscapes", "Religious themes", "Historical events"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Pop Art focuses on mass media and popular culture.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "32364a4e-5977-4b39-95a4-39f50b276e4a", "subject_id": "